<div class="loc-inline-subscribe">
  <div class="loc-inline-subscribe__inner">
    <h2 class="loc-inline-subscribe__heading">Get 15% Off Your Online Order</h2>
    <p class="loc-inline-subscribe__desc">Join our email list to stay updated on our latest treats, events, and exclusive offers. Plus, get 15% off your online order as a welcome gift!</p>
    <div class="loc-inline-subscribe__form">
      {% form 'customer', class: 'newsletter-form' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
        <div class="field">
          <input
            id="NewsletterForm--location-inline"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            class="field__input"
            value="{{ form.email }}"
            aria-required="true"
            autocorrect="off"
            autocapitalize="off"
            autocomplete="email"
            {% if form.errors %}autofocus aria-invalid="true"{% endif %}
            placeholder="Your email address"
            required
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="NewsletterForm--location-inline">Your email address</label>
          <button type="submit" class="newsletter-form__button field__button" name="commit" aria-label="Subscribe">
            <span class="svg-wrapper">Subscribe</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <small class="newsletter-form__message form__message">
            {{- form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email -}}
          </small>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <h3 class="newsletter-form__message newsletter-form__message--success form__message" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            {{- 'newsletter.success' | t }}
          </h3>
        {%- endif -%}
      {% endform %}
    </div>
    <p class="loc-inline-subscribe__footer-note">We'll email your 15% off code right away. Valid for online orders only — not redeemable at our Charlotte area bakeries.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="loc-description">
  <div class="loc-description__inner">
    {%- case loc_slug -%}
      {%- when 'elizabeth' -%}
        <p>Since 2009, Sunflour Baking Company on 7th Street has been the Elizabeth neighborhood's go-to spot for from-scratch pastries, fresh-brewed coffee, and a warm place to start the day. Just steps from Independence Park, our original Charlotte bakery was built on the idea that great food brings people together.</p>
        <p>Stop in for a flakey croissant, a breakfast sandwich made to order, or one of our signature cinnamon buns. Every item is baked in small batches right here, every morning, using all-natural ingredients. Whether you are grabbing coffee on your way to work, settling in with your laptop, or picking up a custom cake for the weekend, the Elizabeth cafe has room for you.</p>
      {%- when 'dilworth' -%}
        <p>Our Dilworth bakery on East Boulevard brings the same from-scratch quality that Charlotte has loved since 2009 to one of the city's most walkable neighborhoods. Tucked into the heart of Dilworth, this cafe is a favorite for morning regulars, weekend brunch crowds, and anyone looking for a real pastry and a good cup of coffee.</p>
        <p>Everything is baked fresh daily in small batches with all-natural ingredients. Grab a seat inside, order a breakfast sandwich or one of our signature croissants, and settle in. The Dilworth location also handles custom cake orders and <a href="/pages/catering">catering</a> for events across the Charlotte area.</p>
      {%- when 'ballantyne' -%}
        <p>Sunflour Baking Company in Ballantyne puts from-scratch baked goods and fresh-brewed coffee within easy reach of south Charlotte. Located in the Conlan Circle shopping center, this cafe is a go-to for Ballantyne families, remote workers, and anyone who appreciates a real bakery.</p>
        <p>Every croissant, muffin, and cinnamon bun is baked right here each morning using all-natural ingredients. We handle custom cakes for birthdays, graduations, and celebrations of all kinds. Stop in before your morning commute or stay a while with free WiFi and plenty of seating.</p>
      {%- when 'harrisburg' -%}
        <p>Our Harrisburg bakery on NC-49 brings Sunflour's from-scratch baking to Cabarrus County. This location serves the Harrisburg, Concord, and northeast Charlotte communities with the same quality we have been known for since 2009.</p>
        <p>Every pastry, bread, and breakfast item is baked fresh each morning in small batches using all-natural ingredients. The cafe has a comfortable atmosphere with free WiFi, making it a great spot to work, meet friends, or just enjoy a quiet coffee. We also offer custom cakes, <a href="/pages/catering">catering</a>, and our signature <a href="/pages/cake-jars">Cake Jars</a> that ship nationwide.</p>
      {%- when 'noda' -%}
        <p>Our newest location on Jordan Place brings Sunflour's from-scratch baking to Charlotte's arts district. The NoDa cafe fits right into the neighborhood's creative energy, with a welcoming atmosphere and the same quality that has made Sunflour a Charlotte staple since 2009.</p>
        <p>Everything is baked fresh daily in small batches using all-natural ingredients. Grab a croissant and a coffee before hitting the NoDa galleries, or settle in with free WiFi and get some work done. We handle custom cake orders, <a href="/pages/catering">catering</a>, and ship our signature <a href="/pages/cake-jars">Cake Jars</a> nationwide.</p>
    {%- endcase -%}
    {%- if loc_landmarks != blank -%}
      <p class="loc-description__landmarks">{{ loc_landmarks }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

