    <div class="panel"><p>Yes, everything. We bake in small batches daily using all-natural ingredients with no artificial flavorings, preservatives, dough conditioners, or bleached or bromated flour.</p></div>

    <button class="accordion">How far in advance do I need to place an order?</button>
